<title>UK: DMG appoints new emerging markets head.</title>
<headline>DMG appoints new emerging markets head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell has appointed Pablo Calderini as head of emerging markets business in Latin America and Eastern Europe, the bank said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Calderini joins from Lehman Brothers, where he was managing director in charge of emerging markets fixed income and currency derivatives.</p>
<p>&quot;The development of a world class emerging markets business is a major priority for global markets,&quot; DMG said in the statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
